    <bf:tableOfContents>
      <bf:TableOfContents>
	<rdfs:label>Sport as a social policy tool in ensuring welfare / Mehmet Öçal -- Welfare through sport : a comparison with the Sport-Friendly Country Index / Mehmet Kasapoglu, Mehmet Öztürk -- A look at the development of sports policies in the world and in Türkiye from a social policy perspective / Mehmet Kasapoglu, Nice Senolan -- Sport in the fight against poverty : a social policy tool or a symbolic substitute for the welfare state? / Ozal Cicek -- Social welfare and sports policies : An evaluation of Türkiye and welfare societies / Mehmet Ulas -- Tax support for sport on the basis of public interest : a comparative analysis of models in Türkiye and selected countries / Hülya Kabakçi Karadeniz -- Targeting sports subsidies for social welfare : principles, paradoxes, and policy implications / Komal Komal, Mahendra Kumar Singh, Sohom Saha, Sumit Kumar Singh -- Playing for equity : Women's sports, social policy, and justice commitments in the global sustainability economy / Rubee Singh -- Social protection of athletes : an evaluation from the perspectives of labour law and social security law / Hatice Erol, Abdullah Özdemir -- Sport as a social policy instrument in Turkey : Welfare effects, social inclusion, and the role of state-led sport programs / Kerem Berkman -- Sport as a social policy tool : advancing welfare, equity, and social development through inclusive sport systems / Rosalie Dela Cruz, Ariel Dela Cruz, Julius De Guzman -- Sport as a social policy tool : enhancing the well-being of individuals with disabilities within welfare state frameworks / Mehmet Bekik, Yener Sisman -- Sport as a strategic social policy tool for strengthening social cohesion and reducing social risk / Sohom Saha, Mahendra Kumar Singh -- Sport social justice and welfare regimes in the promotion of equitable public policy / Sohom Saha, Mahendra Kumar Singh -- Sports-centric welfare : evaluating the efficiency and efficacy of the "Samanta Model" in indigenous social inclusion / Pinaki Pattnaik, Bignya Patnaik -- Football between decommodification and financialization : a discussion within the context of social policy / Mehmet Güler -- The role of sport within social, legal and welfare systems / Çigdem Gökduman, Hasan Aslan.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:TableOfContents>
    </bf:tableOfContents>
    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>"This book explores sport as a catalyst for social welfare, inclusion, equity, and public policy. Drawing on global perspectives, it examines sports' role in poverty reduction, community health, social cohesion, gender equality, athlete protection, disability inclusion, and sustainable societal development"-- Provided by publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
